  {
   "id": 631764,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Which of the following correctly describes the domain and range of the graph below?</p>\n<p><img alt=\"GRAPH OF A LINE FOR ALL X GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 2, WITH POINT SHOWN AT (2, 3), AND PASSING THROUGH THE POINTS (5, 9) AND (8, 15).\" src=\"exercises/media/8f48d3d0af832de9.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222666,
     "content_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p>Domain: <span data-math=\"x > 2\">x &gt; 2</span><br><span>Range: <span data-math=\"y > 3\">y &gt; 3</span></span><br></p>\n<br><p></p>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222665,
     "content_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p>Domain: <span data-math=\"x\\leq2\">x\\leq2</span><br><span>Range: <span data-math=\"y\\leq3\">y\\leq3</span></span><br></p>\n<br><p></p>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222667,
     "content_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p>Domain: <span data-math=\"x\\geq2\">x\\geq2</span><br><span>Range: <span data-math=\"y\\geq3\">y\\geq3</span></span></p>\n<br><p></p>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1222664,
     "content_html": "<p>Domain: <span data-math=\"x\\geq3\">x\\geq3</span><br><span>Range: <span data-math=\"y\\geq2\">y\\geq2</span></span><br></p>"
    }
